  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> The modular premium class </h1>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\"><strong>They are the best you can bring into your team: the premium »venturion« setting and measuring devices.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\">The robust base body is made of a light metal alloy that was specially developed for measuring devices. Only high-quality brand-name components are used and the workmanship of a »venturion« is outstanding. In any configuration and with any optional extension, these precision devices can withstand the highest loads with ease - even in the production hall of an industrial manufacturing facility.</p>",
   "images": [
